  "description": "One day, a mysterious woman appears before Ethan, an orphan who has grown up with nothing. She offers him a large sum of money in exchange for transcribing the Bible and takes him to a remote, ominous mansion. Haunted by rumors surrounding the estate, Ethan feels uneasy—until he meets its master, Leo. The moment their eyes meet, a strange mix of familiarity and confusion washes over him. He tries to brush it off, but that very night, he encounters Leo again—this time, drenched in desire. In a mansion filled with secrets and unsettling happenings, Ethan finds himself drawn into something far beyond his understanding. Will he be able to finish his task and make it out safely?\nSource: MU",
